{
	"openapi": "3.1.0",
	"info": {
		"title": "Identity Verification Services",
		"description": "\n    Identity Verification Service using Face Recognition with Liveness Detection.\n\n    ## Features\n    * Face Registration (enroll new users)\n    * Face Verification (1:1 matching)\n    * Face Identification (1:N search)\n    * Liveness Detection (anti-spoofing)\n    * Face Detection\n\n    ## Technology\n    * **InsightFace** - State-of-the-art face recognition\n    * **Redis** - Fast embedding storage\n\n    ## Performance\n    * Latency: 150-250ms per request (CPU)\n    * Throughput: 40-60 req/s (4 workers)\n    * Accuracy: 99.5%+ face matching\n    ",
		"version": "1.0.0"
	},
